…………………………………….', '{"en":"This moderate loop route to Tuc de Marimanya (2678m) starts from the ample Orri Parking in Plan de Beret, within the Baqueira-Beret ski resort. The trail follows a clear path marked by cairns, initially passing by the Estanys de Baix de Bacivèr.\n\nThe ascent continues, navigating various lakes, generally keeping to their left side. As the route gains elevation, it passes the Estanys de Dalt de Bacivèr, traversing them on the right. The final push to the summit involves finding a suitable line to reach the ridge.\n\nMultiple cairned paths lead to the summit, which is the highest point of the Circ de Baciver. The return journey follows the same route, offering a straightforward descent.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada al Tuc de Marimanya (2678m) comença des de l''ampli aparcament de l''Orri al Pla de Beret, dins de l''estació d''esquí de Baqueira-Beret. El sender segueix un camí clar marcat amb fites, passant inicialment pels Estanys de Baix de Bacivèr.\n\nL''ascens continua, navegant per diversos estanys, generalment mantenint-se a la seva esquerra. A mesura que la ruta guanya altitud, passa pels Estanys de Dalt de Bacivèr, travessant-los per la dreta. L''empenta final cap al cim implica trobar una línia adequada per arribar a la carena.\n\nDiversos camins amb fites condueixen al cim, que és el punt més alt del Circ de Baciver. El retorn segueix la mateixa ruta, oferint un descens senzill.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada al Tuc de Marimanya (2678m) comienza desde el amplio Parking Orri en Plan de Beret, dentro de la estación de esquí de Baqueira-Beret. El sendero sigue un camino claro marcado con hitos, pasando inicialmente por los Estanys de Baix de Bacivèr.\n\nEl ascenso continúa, navegando por varios lagos, generalmente manteniéndose a su izquierda. A medida que la ruta gana altitud, pasa por los Estanys de Dalt de Bacivèr, atravesándolos por la derecha. El empuje final hacia la cumbre implica encontrar una línea adecuada para llegar a la cresta.\n\nMúltiples caminos con hitos conducen a la cumbre, que es el punto más alto del Circ de Baciver. El regreso sigue la misma ruta, ofreciendo un descenso sencillo."}'::jsonb, 'Willy Fogg', 13084, 812, 812, 2680, 1852, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 33660, 2606, '2024-08-30', '2024-07', '[{"lat":42.706598,"lng":0.956443,"ele":1862.6},{"lat":42.706597,"lng":0.956444,"ele":1862.6},{"lat":42.706596,"lng":0.956443,"ele":1862.6},{"lat":42.706593,"lng":0.956443,"ele":1861.2},{"lat":42.706597,"lng":0.95645,"ele":1862.2},{"lat":42.706616,"lng":0.956444,"ele":1862.2},{"lat":42.70662,"lng":0.95645,"ele":1862.2},{"lat":42.706584,"lng":0.956448,"ele":1862.2},{"lat":42.70658,"lng":0.956452,"ele":1862.2},{"lat":42.706572,"lng":0.956452,"ele":1862.2},{"lat":42.706503,"lng":0.956422,"ele":1862.2},{"lat":42.706397,"lng":0.956444,"ele":1862.2},{"lat":42.706358,"lng":0.956483,"ele":1860.7},{"lat":42.706347,"lng":0.956493,"ele":1860.7},{"lat":42.706308,"lng":0.956505,"ele":1860.7},{"lat":42.70621,"lng":0.956584,"ele":1859.3},{"lat":42.706192,"lng":0.956712,"ele":1859.3},{"lat":42.70619,"lng":0.956917,"ele":1858.8},{"lat":42.706188,"lng":0.956946,"ele":1858.8},{"lat":42.706188,"lng":0.957094,"ele":1857.4},{"lat":42.706189,"lng":0.957107,"ele":1857.4},{"lat":42.706191,"lng":0.957269,"ele":1856.4},{"lat":42.706145,"lng":0.957441,"ele":1854.5},{"lat":42.70607,"lng":0.957597,"ele":1854},{"lat":42.70598,"lng":0.957726,"ele":1853.5},{"lat":42.705885,"lng":0.957842,"ele":1853.5},{"lat":42.705768,"lng":0.95797,"ele":1852.6},{"lat":42.705747,"lng":0.957992,"ele":1852.1},{"lat":42.705723,"lng":0.958017,"ele":1852.1},{"lat":42.705632,"lng":0.958127,"ele":1852.1},{"lat":42.705523,"lng":0.958218,"ele":1852.1},{"lat":42.705387,"lng":0.958321,"ele":1852.1},{"lat":42.705266,"lng":0.958402,"ele":1852.1},{"lat":42.705176,"lng":0.958485,"ele":1853.5},{"lat":42.705115,"lng":0.958527,"ele":1854.5},{"lat":42.705079,"lng":0.958548,"ele":1854.5},{"lat":42.704973,"lng":0.958613,"ele":1856.4},{"lat"