-El índice IBP es un sistema de valoración automático que valora el grado de dificultad de la ruta que realizamos.', '{"en":"This demanding 12.9 km one-way route with 1202m of elevation gain ascends Tossal Gros (2256m) and La Carabassa Sud and Nord (2740m). It starts in Talltendre and finishes in the Campllong parking area near Girull.\n\nThe ascent to Tossal Gros from Talltendre is gentle, following tracks, trails, and meadows marked by cairns. The section between Tossal Gros and La Carabassa involves circulating and climbing through wide meadows without significant difficulty. The descent to Campllong includes a challenging, technical section down a steep scree slope to Clot de Fontberenella, followed by a path through meadows, tracks, and forest trails.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta lineal de 12,9 km amb 1202m de desnivell positiu ascendeix al Tossal Gros (2256m) i a La Carabassa Sud i Nord (2740m). Comença a Talltendre i finalitza a la zona d''aparcament del Pla de Campllong, prop de Girull.\n\nL''ascens al Tossal Gros des de Talltendre és suau, seguint pistes, corriols i praderies ben senyalitzades amb fites. La zona entre el Tossal Gros i la Carabassa no presenta dificultat, ja que es transita i s''ascendeix per amples praderies. El descens fins a Campllong inclou un tram dur i tècnic per una tartera amb gran desnivell fins al Clot de Fontberenella, seguit d''un camí per prats, trams de pista i petits senders entre bosc.","es":"Esta exigente ruta lineal de 12,9 km con 1202m de desnivel positivo asciende al Tossal Gros (2256m) y a La Carabassa Sur y Norte (2740m). Comienza en Talltendre y finaliza en la zona de parking del Pla de Campllong, cerca de Girull.\n\nEl ascenso al Tossal Gros desde Talltendre es bastante suave, siguiendo pistas, senderos y praderas bien señalizadas con hitos. La zona entre el Tossal Gros y La Carabassa no presenta dificultad, ya que se circula y se asciende por amplias praderas. El descenso hasta Campllong incluye un tramo duro y técnico por una tartera con gran desnivel hasta el Clot de Fontberenella, seguido de un camino por praderas, tramos de pista y pequeños senderos entre bosque."}'::jsonb, 'nandomoneda', 12939, 1202, 1045, 2738, 1579, 'difficult', 'one-way', NULL, 27060, 1914, '2024-09-09', '2024-08', '[{"lat":42.404052,"lng":1.766737,"ele":1585.3},{"lat":42.404052,"lng":1.766739,"ele":1585.3},{"lat":42.404053,"lng":1.766733,"ele":1580},{"lat":42.404053,"lng":1.766732,"ele":1579.5},{"lat":42.404055,"lng":1.766738,"ele":1579.5},{"lat":42.404005,"lng":1.766766,"ele":1579.1},{"lat":42.404045,"lng":1.766775,"ele":1579.1},{"lat":42.404055,"lng":1.766693,"ele":1579.5},{"lat":42.404071,"lng":1.766551,"ele":1581},{"lat":42.404114,"lng":1.76644,"ele":1583.4},{"lat":42.404146,"lng":1.766318,"ele":1585.3},{"lat":42.404186,"lng":1.76624,"ele":1587.2},{"lat":42.404218,"lng":1.766153,"ele":1588.7},{"lat":42.404189,"lng":1.766085,"ele":1590.6},{"lat":42.404167,"lng":1.766038,"ele":1592},{"lat":42.404191,"lng":1.765987,"ele":1593.5},{"lat":42.404269,"lng":1.765976,"ele":1594.4},{"lat":42.404303,"lng":1.765961,"ele":1595.4},{"lat":42.40435,"lng":1.765914,"ele":1596.8},{"lat":42.40436,"lng":1.765843,"ele":1597.3},{"lat":42.404394,"lng":1.765763,"ele":1598.8},{"lat":42.404399,"lng":1.765657,"ele":1601.6},{"lat":42.404405,"lng":1.765549,"ele":1604.5},{"lat":42.404442,"lng":1.765431,"ele":1606.5},{"lat":42.404486,"lng":1.765307,"ele":1608.9},{"lat":42.404513,"lng":1.765166,"ele":1611.7},{"lat":42.404526,"lng":1.765035,"ele":1614.6},{"lat":42.404532,"lng":1.76493,"ele":1616.1},{"lat":42.404529,"lng":1.764814,"ele":1618.5},{"lat":42.404531,"lng":1.764806,"ele":1618.5},{"lat":42.404537,"lng":1.764676,"ele":1620.4},{"lat":42.404554,"lng":1.764556,"ele":1622.8},{"lat":42.404574,"lng":1.764446,"ele":1624.7},{"lat":42.404594,"lng":1.764328,"ele":1626.6},{"lat":42.40463,"lng":1.764231,"ele":1629},{"lat":42.404658,"lng":1.764134,"ele":1631},{"lat":42.404698,"lng":1.764022,"ele":1632.4},{"lat":42.404733,"lng":1.763882,"e