('wikiloc', '184411240', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/llacs-de-tristania-rellotge-solar-mirador-pic-creussans-pic-de-cabanyo-100-cims-184411240', 'Tristania Lakes - Sundial (Viewpoint) - Creussans Peak - Cabanyó Peak 100 Summits', '{"en":"Tristania Lakes and Creussans Peak Loop","ca":"Circular llacs de Tristania i pic Creussans","es":"Circular lagos de Tristania y pico Creussans"}'::jsonb, 'Llacs de Tristania- Rellotge solar (Mirador) -Pic Creussans-Pic de Cabanyó 100 cims Hiking trail in El Serrat, Ordino (Andorra). Download its GPS track and follow the route on a map. Record your own itinerary from the Wikiloc app, upload the trail and share it with the community.', '{"en":"This moderate 10.6 km loop with 950m of elevation gain starts from the Coma del Forat parking area in Ordino-Arcalís. The route ascends to the Pic de Cabanyó, passing by the Tristaina Lakes and the Sundial Viewpoint.\n\nThe trail involves a sustained climb, particularly towards the summits of Creussans and Cabanyó. The terrain is generally well-defined, but the final ascent to Cabanyó includes some exposed sections requiring attention.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 10,6 km amb 950m de desnivell positiu comença des de l''aparcament de la Coma del Forat a Ordino-Arcalís. L''itinerari puja al Pic de Cabanyó, passant pels Llacs de Tristaina i el Mirador del Rellotge Solar.\n\nEl camí implica una pujada sostinguda, especialment cap als cims de Creussans i Cabanyó. El terreny està generalment ben definit, però l''ascens final al Cabanyó inclou algunes seccions exposades que requereixen atenció.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 10,6 km con 950m de desnivel positivo comienza desde el aparcamiento de la Coma del Forat en Ordino-Arcalís. El itinerario asciende al Pic de Cabanyó, pasando por los Lagos de Tristaina y el Mirador del Reloj Solar.\n\nEl camino implica una subida sostenida, especialmente hacia las cumbres de Creussans y Cabanyó. El terreno está generalmente bien definido, pero el ascenso final al Cabanyó incluye algunas secciones expuestas que requieren atención."}'::jsonb, 'paquilian68', 10557, 950, 950, 2735, 1943, 'moderate', 'loop', 14520, 21240, 1893, '2024-09-09', '2024-08', '[{"lat":42.632624,"lng":1.500154,"ele":1963.3},{"lat":42.632565,"lng":1.500119,"ele":1963.3},{"lat":42.632596,"lng":1.500074,"ele":1963.3},{"lat":42.63262,"lng":1.500014,"ele":1961.3},{"lat":42.632665,"lng":1.500025,"ele":1961.3},{"lat":42.632707,"lng":1.500051,"ele":1962.3},{"lat":42.632731,"lng":1.500106,"ele":1963.3},{"lat":42.632777,"lng":1.500127,"ele":1964.3},{"lat":42.632808,"lng":1.500171,"ele":1964.3},{"lat":42.632826,"lng":1.50024,"ele":1964.3},{"lat":42.632876,"lng":1.500256,"ele":1962.3},{"lat":42.632829,"lng":1.500237,"ele":1960.3},{"lat":42.632867,"lng":1.500289,"ele":1954.3},{"lat":42.632888,"lng":1.500358,"ele":1954.3},{"lat":42.632882,"lng":1.500436,"ele":1954.3},{"lat":42.632914,"lng":1.500479,"ele":1953.3},{"lat":42.632963,"lng":1.50046,"ele":1952.3},{"lat":42.63301,"lng":1.500488,"ele":1952.3},{"lat":42.633038,"lng":1.500549,"ele":1950.3},{"lat":42.633062,"lng":1.500609,"ele":1950.3},{"lat":42.633078,"lng":1.500672,"ele":1950.3},{"lat":42.633099,"lng":1.500727,"ele":1950.3},{"lat":42.633122,"lng":1.500784,"ele":1950.3},{"lat":42.633134,"lng":1.500852,"ele":1950.3},{"lat":42.633145,"lng":1.500915,"ele":1949.3},{"lat":42.633175,"lng":1.500971,"ele":1949.3},{"lat":42.633187,"lng":1.501039,"ele":1949.3},{"lat":42.63321,"lng":1.501098,"ele":1949.3},{"lat":42.633218,"lng":1.501166,"ele":1949.3},{"lat":42.633236,"lng":1.501237,"ele":1949.3},{"lat":42.633241,"lng":1.501309,"ele":1948.3},{"lat":42.633252,"lng":1.501375,"ele":1948.3},{"lat":42.633263,"lng":1.501436,"ele":1948.3},{"lat":42.633297,"lng":1.501486,"ele":1948.3},{"lat":42.633302,"lng":1.50156,"ele":1947.3},{"lat":42.633305,"lng":1.501626,"ele":1947.3},{"lat":42.633317,"lng":1.501695,"ele":1946.3},{"lat":42.633318,"lng":1.501766,"ele":1946.3},{"lat":42.633335,"lng":1.501835,"ele":