TOSSAL DE L''ÀLIGA (100 cims): https://ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-senderisme/tossal-de-laliga-o-la-geganta-adormida-100-cims-i-visita-al-poble-de-peracalc-baix-pallars-pallars-186764969 
 
EL CODÓ (100 cims): https://ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-senderisme/el-codo-100-cims-dolmen-de-la-cabaneta-del-moro-i-sant-roc-cervoles-senterada-pallars-jussa-186667323', '{"en":"This short, easy loop starts at Coll de Montllobar, accessible via the C-1311 from Tremp. Park at the pass and cross the road to begin on a gently ascending track.\n\nThe route passes below Montllobar Castle before heading towards the summit. Follow the track until cairns indicate a path to the left, which becomes steeper. A small scramble is required before reaching the Montllobar summit, marked by a geodesic vertex. The return path is the same as the ascent, as other options can be confusing.\n\nThis 4.3 km loop with 181m of elevation gain is suitable for an easy outing, offering good views from the summit.","ca":"Aquesta curta i fàcil ruta circular comença al Coll de Montllobar, accessible per la C-1311 des de Tremp. Aparqueu al coll i creueu la carretera per començar per una pista que puja suaument.\n\nLa ruta passa per sota del Castell de Montllobar abans de dirigir-se cap al cim. Seguiu la pista fins que unes fites indiquen un corriol a l''esquerra, que es torna més vertical. Cal una petita grimpada abans d''arribar al cim de Montllobar, marcat per un vèrtex geodèsic. El camí de tornada és el mateix que el de pujada, ja que altres opcions poden ser confuses.\n\nAquesta ruta circular de 4,3 km amb 181 m de desnivell positiu és adequada per a una sortida fàcil, oferint bones vistes des del cim.","es":"Esta corta y fácil ruta circular comienza en el Coll de Montllobar, accesible por la C-1311 desde Tremp. Aparque en el collado y cruce la carretera para empezar por una pista que sube suavemente.\n\nLa ruta pasa por debajo del Castillo de Montllobar antes de dirigirse hacia la cima. Siga la pista hasta que unos hitos indiquen un sendero a la izquierda, que se vuelve más vertical. Se requiere una pequeña trepada antes de llegar a la cima de Montllobar, marcada por un vértice geodésico. El camino de regreso es el mismo que el de subida, ya que otras opciones pueden ser confusas.\n\nEsta ruta circular de 4,3 km con 181 m de desnivel positivo es adecuada para una salida fácil, ofreciendo buenas vistas desde la cima."}'::jsonb, 'FERRARI100', 4297, 181, 181, 1107, 958, 'easy', 'loop', 1080, 9420, 763, '2024-10-01', '2024-09', '[{"lat":42.156389,"lng":0.797982,"ele":959.6},{"lat":42.156386,"lng":0.798045,"ele":959.6},{"lat":42.156346,"lng":0.798012,"ele":962.6},{"lat":42.156301,"lng":0.798028,"ele":963.6},{"lat":42.156254,"lng":0.798042,"ele":963.1},{"lat":42.156209,"lng":0.798035,"ele":962.6},{"lat":42.156168,"lng":0.798007,"ele":963.6},{"lat":42.156128,"lng":0.797981,"ele":963.6},{"lat":42.156082,"lng":0.797947,"ele":959.6},{"lat":42.156068,"lng":0.797883,"ele":957.6},{"lat":42.156056,"lng":0.797946,"ele":957.6},{"lat":42.156052,"lng":0.798009,"ele":959.6},{"lat":42.156023,"lng":0.798058,"ele":960.6},{"lat":42.15599,"lng":0.79811,"ele":961.6},{"lat":42.155948,"lng":0.798143,"ele":963.6},{"lat":42.155905,"lng":0.798163,"ele":964.6},{"lat":42.155855,"lng":0.798182,"ele":967.6},{"lat":42.155808,"lng":0.798198,"ele":969.1},{"lat":42.155761,"lng":0.798206,"ele":970.6},{"lat":42.155713,"lng":0.798216,"ele":971.6},{"lat":42.155659,"lng":0.798219,"ele":974.6},{"lat":42.155603,"lng":0.798227,"ele":974.6},{"lat":42.155559,"lng":0.798241,"ele":974.6},{"lat":42.155515,"lng":0.798262,"ele":974.6},{"lat":42.155474,"lng":0.798313,"ele":973.6},{"lat":42.155434,"lng":0.798355,"ele":973.6},{"lat":42.155385,"lng":0.798377,"ele":974.6},{"lat":42.155334,"lng":0.798372,"ele":974.6},{"lat":42.155296,"lng":0.798337,"ele":975.6},{"lat":42.155279,"lng":0.798279,"ele":977.6},{"lat":42.155251,"lng":0.798231,"ele":977.6},{"lat":42.155209,"lng":0.798167,"ele":977.6},{"lat":42.155182,"lng":0.798117,"ele":977.6},{"lat":42.155154,"lng":0.798058,"ele":976.6},{"lat":42.155129,"lng":0.797993,"ele":975.6},{"lat":42.155108,"lng":0.797933,"ele":974.6},{"lat":42.155086,"lng":0.797876,"ele":974.6},{"la