('wikiloc', '187612319', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/puigdefrou-i-ruta-de-les-pedreres-passant-pel-dolmen-de-colldegria-i-la-cova-del-pasteral-des-de-la-187612319', 'Puigdefrou and the Quarry Route, passing the Colldegria Dolmen and the Pasteral Cave, from La Cellera de Ter', '{"en":"Circular via Quarry, Dolmen, and Cave","ca":"Circular per Pedreres, Dolmen i Cova","es":"Circular por Cantera, Dolmen y Cueva"}'::jsonb, 'Puigdefrou i ruta de les pedreres, passant pel dolmen de Colldegria i la cova del Pasteral, des de la Cellera de Ter Hiking trail in la Cellera de Ter, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ruta circular des de l''Oratori de Sant Benet de Palerm, passant per: 
 
- oratori de Sant Benet de Palerm (0.0 km) 
- Safareig de la Canal (0.7 km) 
- Pedrera de l''Esquei d''en Pujol (2.6 km) 
- pedrera de la Valona (3.0 km) 
- Ruïnes de Becdejuvell (4.9 km) 
- Puigdefrou, la creu (5.8 km) 
- Puigdefrou, el cim (6.0 km) 
- Pedrera de la font de l''arç (9.3 km) 
- Coll de la Palomera (10.5 km) 
- la Ferreria (11.0 km) 
- Pedrera de Colldegria (11.8 km) 
- Dolmen de Colldegria (12.2 km) 
- pedrera d''en Moner (13.2 km) 
- Cova del Pasteral (13.6 km) 
 
la ruta, la comencem al mateix lloc on l''acabem. Al track hi falten els primers metres, des del pàrquing fins a l''oratori de Sant Benet de Palerm.', '{"en":"This moderate 15.1 km loop starts and ends at the Oratori de Sant Benet de Palerm in La Cellera de Ter, offering 944m of elevation gain. The route explores the Puigdefrou area, passing through several old quarries like Esquei d''en Pujol and La Valona, and visiting the ruins of Becdejuvell.\n\nThe trail ascends to Puigdefrou, reaching both its cross and the main summit. On the descent, it continues past the Font de l''Arç quarry, Coll de la Palomera, La Ferreria, and the Colldegria quarry. A notable stop is the Dolmen de Colldegria, followed by the Moner quarry and the Cova del Pasteral before returning to the start.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 15.1 km, amb 944 m de desnivell positiu, comença i acaba a l''Oratori de Sant Benet de Palerm a La Cellera de Ter. El recorregut explora la zona del Puigdefrou, passant per diverses antigues pedreres com la de l''Esquei d''en Pujol i la Valona, i visitant les ruïnes de Becdejuvell.\n\nEl camí puja al Puigdefrou, assolint tant la seva creu com el cim principal. Durant el descens, passa per la pedrera de la Font de l''Arç, el Coll de la Palomera, la Ferreria i la pedrera de Colldegria. Una parada destacada és el Dolmen de Colldegria, seguit per la pedrera d''en Moner i la Cova del Pasteral abans de tornar al punt d''inici.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 15.1 km, con 944 m de desnivel positivo, comienza y termina en el Oratori de Sant Benet de Palerm en La Cellera de Ter. El recorrido explora la zona del Puigdefrou, pasando por varias antiguas canteras como la de l''Esquei d''en Pujol y la Valona, y visitando las ruinas de Becdejuvell.\n\nEl sendero asciende al Puigdefrou, alcanzando tanto su cruz como la cima principal. Durante el descenso, pasa por la cantera de la Font de l''Arç, el Coll de la Palomera, La Ferreria y la cantera de Colldegria. Una parada destacada es el Dolmen de Colldegria, seguido por la cantera d''en Moner y la Cova del Pasteral antes de regresar al punto de inicio."}'::jsonb, 'Josep M Fusté', 15128, 944, 944, 835, 155, 'moderate', 'loop', 13200, 21780, 2612, '2024-10-07', '2024-09', '[{"lat":41.973456,"lng":2.618199,"ele":188.6},{"lat":41.973578,"lng":2.618342,"ele":188.6},{"lat":41.97351,"lng":2.618375,"ele":188.6},{"lat":41.973473,"lng":2.618305,"ele":188.6},{"lat":41.973503,"lng":2.618365,"ele":188.6},{"lat":41.973565,"lng":2.618485,"ele":188.9},{"lat":41.973558,"lng":2.618392,"ele":188.9},{"lat":41.973586,"lng":2.618344,"ele":188.4},{"lat":41.973554,"lng":2.618387,"ele":185.2},{"lat":41.973532,"lng":2.618449,"ele":183.3},{"lat":41.973485,"lng":2.618484,"ele":183.3},{"lat":41.973442,"lng":2.618524,"ele":181.1},{"lat":41.973399,"lng":2.618549,"ele":181.1},{"lat":41.973354,"lng":2.618596,"ele":181.1},{"lat":41.973309,"lng":2.618641,"ele":178.9},{"lat":41.973279,"lng":2.618688,"ele":178.8},{"lat":41.973259,"lng":2.618745,"ele":178.8},{"lat":41.973227,"lng":2.6188,"ele":178.9},{"lat":41.973189,"lng":2.618852,"ele":179.7},{"lat":41.973157,"lng":2.618914,"ele":179.6},{"lat":41.973125,"lng":2.618969,"ele":179.7},{"lat":41.973082,"lng":2.619004,"ele":179.3},{"lat":41.973034,"lng":2.619036,"ele":179},{"lat":41.972989,"lng":2.619069,"ele":178.4},{"lat":41.972942,"lng":2.619112,"ele":177},{"lat":41.972895,"lng":2.619107,"ele":176.8},{"lat":41.97285,"lng":2.61912,"ele":176.6},{"lat":41.972798,"lng":2.619147,"ele":176.3},{"lat":41.972753,"lng":2.619164,"ele":176.2},{"lat":41.972703,"lng":2.619187,"ele":176.2},{"lat":41.972655,"lng":2.619225,"ele":176.2},{"lat":41.972607,"lng":2.61927,"ele":176.6},{"lat":41.972564,"lng":2.619295,"ele":177.1},{"lat":41.972526,"lng":2.619327,"ele":178.1},{"lat":41.972469,"lng":2.619342,"ele":178.6},{"lat":41.972437,"lng":2.619385,"ele":178.9},{"lat":41.972385,"lng":2.619415,"ele":178.9},{"lat":41.972343,"lng":2.619455,"ele":178.9},{"lat":41.9723,"lng":2.619483,"ele":178.