('wikiloc', '18846564', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/andorra-casamanya-nord-2-753-m-per-montaup-100-cims-18846564', 'Andorra - Casamanya Nord 2,753 m via Montaup - 100 peaks', '{"en":"Loop via Montaup with chains","ca":"Circular per Montaup amb cadenes","es":"Circular por Montaup con cadenas"}'::jsonb, 'Andorra - Casamanya nord 2.753 m per Montaup - 100 cims Hiking trail in Canillo, Canillo (Andorra). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Magnífica ruta circular pel massís de Casamanya, amb una divertida pujada per les cadenes des del coll d''Arenes i unes vistes espectaculars des del cim de totes les muntanyes andorranes i més. 
 
 Hora Inici: 07/14/2017 08:44Hora Fi: 07/14/2017 15:12Distància recorreguda: 10,1 km (06:27)Temps en moviment: 03:05Velocitat mitjana: 1,57 km/hVel. en Mov.: 3,29 km/hVelocitat Màxima: 5,5 km/hAltura Mínima: 1859 mAltura Màxima: 2703 mVelocitat d''Ascens: 311,6 m/hVelocitat de Descens: -303,5 m/hGuany d''altitud: 988 mPèrdua d''altitud: -984 mTemps d''Ascens: 03:10Temps de Descens: 03:14', '{"en":"This moderate 9.7 km loop to Casamanya Nord via Montaup features a challenging ascent with chains from Coll d''Arenes, offering a fun and technical element to the climb.\n\nThe route starts from the Montaup area and leads to the summit of Casamanya Nord (2753m), providing extensive views of the Andorran mountains. The 880m elevation gain is spread over a varied path.\n\nIt''s a magnificent circular route for hikers seeking a mix of well-trodden paths and a short, exciting section with fixed chains, suitable for those with some mountain experience.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 9.7 km al Casamanya Nord per Montaup inclou una pujada exigent amb cadenes des del Coll d''Arenes, afegint un element divertit i tècnic a l''ascens.\n\nLa ruta comença des de la zona de Montaup i porta al cim del Casamanya Nord (2753m), oferint àmplies vistes de les muntanyes andorranes. El desnivell de 880m es distribueix per un camí variat.\n\nÉs una magnífica ruta circular per a excursionistes que busquen una combinació de senders ben marcats i una secció curta i emocionant amb cadenes fixes, apta per a aquells amb certa experiència en muntanya.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 9.7 km al Casamanya Nord por Montaup presenta una subida exigente con cadenas desde el Coll d''Arenes, añadiendo un elemento divertido y técnico a la ascensión.\n\nLa ruta comienza desde la zona de Montaup y lleva a la cumbre del Casamanya Nord (2753m), ofreciendo amplias vistas de las montañas andorranas. El desnivel de 880m se distribuye por un camino variado.\n\nEs una magnífica ruta circular para excursionistas que buscan una mezcla de senderos bien marcados y una sección corta y emocionante con cadenas fijas, adecuada para aquellos con cierta experiencia en montaña."}'::jsonb, 'Imperdibles', 9672, 880, 880, 2703, 1860, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 23220, 1732, '2017-07-26', '2017-06', '[{"lat":42.572986,"lng":1.586477,"ele":1859.6},{"lat":42.573017,"lng":1.586463,"ele":1866.1},{"lat":42.573062,"lng":1.586453,"ele":1872},{"lat":42.573097,"lng":1.586517,"ele":1873.1},{"lat":42.573147,"lng":1.58651,"ele":1872},{"lat":42.573198,"lng":1.586513,"ele":1866.7},{"lat":42.573242,"lng":1.586495,"ele":1865.9},{"lat":42.573293,"lng":1.586487,"ele":1866.5},{"lat":42.57333,"lng":1.586448,"ele":1867.6},{"lat":42.57338,"lng":1.586417,"ele":1868.7},{"lat":42.573428,"lng":1.586398,"ele":1868.8},{"lat":42.573473,"lng":1.58639,"ele":1868.7},{"lat":42.573527,"lng":1.586385,"ele":1868.3},{"lat":42.573577,"lng":1.586387,"ele":1867},{"lat":42.573623,"lng":1.586372,"ele":1865.4},{"lat":42.57361,"lng":1.586313,"ele":1866.1},{"lat":42.573563,"lng":1.58631,"ele":1866.7},{"lat":42.573518,"lng":1.58628,"ele":1867.8},{"lat":42.573528,"lng":1.58621,"ele":1868.6},{"lat":42.57349,"lng":1.586163,"ele":1870.7},{"lat":42.573528,"lng":1.586128,"ele":1871.3},{"lat":42.573568,"lng":1.586087,"ele":1871.7},{"lat":42.573603,"lng":1.586047,"ele":1871.8},{"lat":42.57364,"lng":1.585993,"ele":1872.1},{"lat":42.573672,"lng":1.585938,"ele":1872.3},{"lat":42.5737,"lng":1.585883,"ele":1872.6},{"lat":42.573727,"lng":1.585827,"ele":1872.9},{"lat":42.573772,"lng":1.585787,"ele":1873.3},{"lat":42.57382,"lng":1.58575,"ele":1873.7},{"lat":42.573867,"lng":1.585725,"ele":1874},{"lat":42.573917,"lng":1.585707,"ele":1873.9},{"lat":42.573965,"lng":1.585682,"ele":1873.9},{"lat":42.574017,"lng":1.585662,"ele":1874},{"lat":42.574072,"lng":1.585662,"ele":1875.1},{"lat":42.574125,"lng":1.58567,"ele":1876.2},{"lat":42.57417,"lng":1.585663,"ele":1877.1},{"lat":42.574213,"lng":1.585643,"ele":1877.3},{"lat":42.574262,"lng":1.585647,"ele"