('wikiloc', '192348560', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/puig-neulos-roc-dels-tres-termes-i-coll-forcat-des-de-la-teuleria-de-requesens-192348560', 'Puig Neulós, Roc dels Tres Termes and Coll Forcat from La Teuleria de Requesens', '{"en":"Circular via Roc dels Tres Termes from Requesens","ca":"Circular per Roc dels Tres Termes des de Requesens","es":"Circular por Roc dels Tres Termes desde Requesens"}'::jsonb, 'Puig Neulós, Roc dels Tres Termes i Coll Forcat des de la Teuleria de Requesens Hiking trail in Requesens, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ruta circular des del Forn de totxos de Requesens (la teuleria), passant per: 
- Pont de les Cutives (0.3 km) 
- Coll del Faig (4.6 km) 
- Coll Pregon (5.6 km) 
- puig Pregon (5.9 km) 
- Refugi de la Tanyareda (6.1 km) 
- Font de la Tanyareda (6.7 km) 
- Puig Neulós (7.9 km) 
- Coll del Pou (9.2 km) 
- Roc dels Tres Termes (10.1 km) 
 - Coll Forcadell (12.1 km) 
- Coll Forcat (12.6 km) 
- Font de la Verneda (13.1 km) 
- Ermita de Requesens (15.1 km) 
- Font Rovellada (15.6 km)', '{"en":"This moderate 15.8 km loop starts at La Teuleria de Requesens, accessible via a dirt track. The route offers a varied terrain, passing through several cols and a refuge, making it a good option for hikers looking for a full day out.\n\nThe trail leads you over Pont de les Cutives, Coll del Faig, and Coll Pregon before reaching Puig Pregon and the Refugi de la Tanyareda. You''ll then ascend to Puig Neulós, continue to Roc dels Tres Termes, and pass through Coll Forcat on the return.\n\nThe final section descends past Font de la Verneda and the Ermita de Requesens, completing the loop with a total elevation gain of 845 meters. The path is well-defined, suitable for experienced hikers.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 15,8 km s''inicia a la Teuleria de Requesens, accessible per una pista forestal. El recorregut ofereix un terreny variat, passant per diversos colls i un refugi, ideal per a una jornada completa de senderisme.\n\nEl camí us porta pel Pont de les Cutives, el Coll del Faig i el Coll Pregon abans d''arribar al Puig Pregon i al Refugi de la Tanyareda. Després ascendireu al Puig Neulós, continuant cap al Roc dels Tres Termes i passant pel Coll Forcat en el retorn.\n\nLa secció final descendeix per la Font de la Verneda i l''Ermita de Requesens, completant el circuit amb un desnivell acumulat de 845 metres. El sender està ben marcat i és adequat per a excursionistes amb experiència.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 15,8 km comienza en la Teuleria de Requesens, accesible por una pista forestal. El recorrido ofrece un terreno variado, pasando por varios collados y un refugio, ideal para una jornada completa de senderismo.\n\nEl camino le lleva por el Pont de les Cutives, el Coll del Faig y el Coll Pregon antes de llegar al Puig Pregon y al Refugi de la Tanyareda. Luego ascenderá al Puig Neulós, continuando hacia el Roc dels Tres Termes y pasando por el Coll Forcat en el regreso.\n\nLa sección final desciende por la Font de la Verneda y la Ermita de Requesens, completando el circuito con un desnivel acumulado de 845 metros. El sendero está bien marcado y es adecuado para excursionistas con experiencia."}'::jsonb, 'Josep M Fusté', 15820, 845, 845, 1255, 434, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 24000, 2742, '2024-11-19', '2024-10', '[{"lat":42.452048,"lng":2.94295,"ele":468.9},{"lat":42.451995,"lng":2.94287,"ele":468.9},{"lat":42.45197,"lng":2.942818,"ele":468.2},{"lat":42.451972,"lng":2.942756,"ele":469.3},{"lat":42.452009,"lng":2.942703,"ele":479.9},{"lat":42.452021,"lng":2.942766,"ele":479.9},{"lat":42.451979,"lng":2.942738,"ele":479.9},{"lat":42.451929,"lng":2.942733,"ele":474},{"lat":42.451927,"lng":2.942665,"ele":473.4},{"lat":42.451969,"lng":2.942632,"ele":473.4},{"lat":42.452024,"lng":2.942679,"ele":473.5},{"lat":42.452066,"lng":2.942709,"ele":474.8},{"lat":42.452026,"lng":2.942737,"ele":475.9},{"lat":42.452031,"lng":2.942805,"ele":476},{"lat":42.452013,"lng":2.94274,"ele":476.9},{"lat":42.45202,"lng":2.942813,"ele":475.2},{"lat":42.452037,"lng":2.942878,"ele":474.7},{"lat":42.452064,"lng":2.942933,"ele":474},{"lat":42.452097,"lng":2.942976,"ele":474.7},{"lat":42.452129,"lng":2.943029,"ele":475.2},{"lat":42.452159,"lng":2.943079,"ele":472.5},{"lat":42.452196,"lng":2.943117,"ele":470.9},{"lat":42.452248,"lng":2.943137,"ele":470.9},{"lat":42.452295,"lng":2.943144,"ele":470.1},{"lat":42.45235,"lng":2.943152,"ele":469.7},{"lat":42.452395,"lng":2.94318,"ele":470.5},{"lat":42.452445,"lng":2.943177,"ele":470.5},{"lat":42.452493,"lng":2.943209,"ele":470.5},{"lat":42.452551,"lng":2.943229,"ele":471.3},{"lat":42.452599,"lng":2.943226,"ele":468.4},{"lat":42.452652,"lng":2.943219,"ele":467.5},{"lat":42.452702,"lng":2.943192,"ele":467.2},{"lat":42.452752,"lng":2.943172,"ele":467.2},{"lat":42.452804,"lng":2.943157,"ele":467.2},{"lat":42.452862,"lng":2.94314,"ele":467.1},{"lat":42.452907,"lng":2.943138,"ele":467.3},{"lat":42.452964,"lng":2.943111,"ele":467.3},{"lat":42.453032,"lng":2.943078,"el